      <LearningUnit
        heading="you gon' need a warrant for that — 第4修正条項と gon'"
        label="★ 文法／文化（最重要）"
        mc="Jay-Z（Verse 2）"
        t={TS["warrant-rights"].t} tApprox={TS["warrant-rights"].approx} youtubeId={YT}
        embed=""
      >
        <Fragment slot="eng">And I know my rights, so you gon' need a warrant for that</Fragment>
        <Fragment slot="jpn">俺は自分の権利を知ってる、だからそれには令状が要るぜ</Fragment>
